# (build 131) The Control Tower's ground floor has the longest interaction
# list in the ROM: 70 entries, the last a row of stairs up to
# ControlTowerF1 (y 43, x 37 to 89). The port kept 64 doors a level, so
# the last six were dropped, and walking into the stair at x 69 fell
# through to the exit table and out to Piata (build 131's round-trip
# found it). Entry 64 (the 65th): cell 69,43 up, to ControlTowerF1 70,43.
start level $3E 69 45
wait idle
walk up 2
wait idle
shot 01_under_the_stair
walk up 1                    # into the stair: the interaction list
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $3F 70 43
shot 02_first_floor
expect no-stderr doors
